OL,3,GNEWSAHospital trust planning 'up to 350
OL,4,Aredundancies'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hospital trust is preparing to make
OL,7,Fup to 350 job cuts, including some
OL,8,Fclinical roles, according to a union.
OL,10,FUniversity Hospital's North Midlands
OL,11,FTrust has said it was facing pressure
OL,12,Fon its budgets as well as increased
OL,13,Fdemand on its services as winter
OL,14,Fapproaches.
OL,16,FThe trust confirmed it was launching a
OL,17,Ftime-limited voluntary redundancy
OL,18,Fscheme and a period of restricted
OL,19,Frecruitment. Patient safety and
OL,20,Fcontinuity remained its priority, it
OL,21,Fadded.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
