OL,3,GNEWSAHospital trust planning 'up to 350
OL,4,Aredundancies'
OL,5,
OL,6,FChanel Camilleri-Willis, from the union
OL,7,FUnison, said the potential for job
OL,8,Flosses was "massively worrying" for
OL,9,Fstaff and said it had been a "rushed
OL,10,Fcourse of action".
